          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Entire Brain's plugin lacked client-side hosted fact sync: repositories could not automatically publish local facts to and pull teammates' facts from a hosted brain service. Users had no way to connect a local repository to its hosted brain, sync facts across branches and machines, or receive server-stamped author attribution.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Solution:",
                "type": "text",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "bold",
                    "attrs": {}
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "The branch adds end-to-end hosted fact sync with four foundational components:",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "orderedList",
            "attrs": {
              "start": 1
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "text": "Repository connection",
