            "content": [
              {
                "text": "The sync loop reads local facts, publishes via CAS (compare-and-swap), records per-branch sync state, fetches the settled head with server-stamped authors, and merges into the local store; teammates' facts become first-class in brief/recall without manual commands beyond initial connect.",
